"Automatic confirmation commits stable leading Chinese words as you continue typing or pause, keeping the ending editable. Editing or choosing candidates pauses it until you type again. It does not train app vocabulary. Return and shortcuts keep the remaining original spelling." = "在连续输入或暂停时，自动确认开头已稳定的中文词语，并保留可编辑的结尾。编辑或选择候选后会暂停，直到再次输入。此功能不会学习应用词汇。回车键和快捷键会保留剩余的原始拼写。";
"Automatically confirm stable prefixes" = "自动确认稳定前缀";
"Both options are off by default and stay on this Mac. Vocabulary expires after 90 days without use (5,000 entries total); history after 30 days (1,000 entries total, up to 4,096 bytes each for spelling and text). Editing committed text, shortcuts, focus changes and secure input discard unfinished history. No document or clipboard content is read. You can pause either feature for an individual app in Manage App Data." = "这两个选项默认关闭，数据仅保存在本机。词汇在 90 天未使用后过期（总计最多 5,000 条）；历史记录在 30 天后过期（总计最多 1,000 条，每条拼写和文本各最多 4,096 字节）。编辑已提交文本、使用快捷键、切换焦点或安全输入都会丢弃未完成的历史记录。SI 不读取文档或剪贴板内容。可在“管理应用数据”中为单个应用暂停任一功能。";
